  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.7: Fixed thinking-off being silently dropped for models whose id does not contain \"qwen3\", and fixed enable_thinking being sent as a top-level parameter (instead of chat_template_kwargs) on vLLM. Thinking parameters now follow the configured ThinkingMode without model-name guessing. No API changes.",
